# Default review ownership.
#
# Two owners, deliberately. With a single code owner and
# "require review from Code Owners" enabled, that person's own pull requests
# can never be approved by anyone, and Dependabot pull requests touching an
# owned path stall indefinitely. That is what happened here: nine Dependabot
# pull requests sat open for up to eleven weeks.
